>   	/* Associate QP with CEP */
> +	down_write(&qp->state_lock);

What could destroy the QP at this point, so
that we need a lock? The RDMA core should serialize
any user initiated QP destroy during the connect.

>   	siw_cep_get(cep);
>   	qp->cep = cep;
>   
